      {
        "day": "Day 1: Zen Landscapes of Arashiyama",
        "morningActivity": "Explore Tenryu-ji Temple, a premier Zen site with a 14th-century garden that survived centuries of fires.",
        "afternoonActivity": "Walk through the Sagano Bamboo Grove and visit the quiet Okochi Sanso Villa for matcha and a view of the Hozugawa River.",
        "eveningActivity": "Dinner in the Pontocho Alley neighborhood, famous for its narrow atmospheric lanes and riverside dining.",
        "image": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Tenryu-ji_Sogenchi_Garden.jpg/1200px-Tenryu-ji_Sogenchi_Garden.jpg",
